  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRA - POWER OF VOICES PARTNERSHIP UGANDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RRA shall hold companies accountable for their harmful behavior, raise awareness among financial institutions and share holders of what kind of activities they are investing in, and push for stronger policies within companies, financial institutions and at Government level for more responsible business conduct. The sudden influencing opportunity arose after Ugandan CSOs participated in the Fair Finance training in Uganda in October 2022 and discussed how influencing financial institutions and investors in these private companies can form another - complementary &#x2013; strand of influencing to be part of their advocacy and Influencing work for a more responsible private and financial sector.</narrative>
  </description>
